{
  "document_id": "legacy/story/4dd4fa178fb1/ch19",
  "extensions": {
    "legacy": {
      "chapter": 19,
      "location": "隊伍進入北方黑森林,途中遭死亡骷髏傭兵團伏擊,幸而巧遇巴拿羅西亞與凱拉斯協助殲敵。得知聖寇拉斯已察覺線索,先行趕往精靈聖地西方高塔——聖靈之塔,眾人決議儘速與其會合。",
      "source_dat": "FDTXT_019",
      "title": "第十九章 — 黑森林逢敵,巧遇巴拿羅西亞"
    }
  },
  "kind": "story",
  "scenes": [
    {
      "beats": [],
      "extensions": {
        "legacy": {
          "label": "黑森林遇死亡骷髏偷襲"
        }
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 0,
              "speaker_name": "索爾"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/4dd4fa178fb1/scenes/0/lines/0",
          "speaker": "character/native-0",
          "text": "真令人不舒服的森林!這裡是什麼地方?"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 21,
              "speaker_name": "約拿"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/4dd4fa178fb1/scenes/0/lines/1",
          "speaker": "character/native-21",
          "text": "這是大陸北方山脈之麓的黑森林,由於山脈和濃密的森林阻擋陽光,這一帶看起來總是陰森森的,一般旅人都不敢行經此處。"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 8,
              "speaker_name": "希莉亞"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/4dd4fa178fb1/scenes/0/lines/2",
          "speaker": "character/native-8",
          "text": "過了此地,也就快到死之沼澤了,聽說曾有人在這一帶遭怪物攻擊...."
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 3,
              "speaker_name": "哈瓦特"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/4dd4fa178fb1/scenes/0/lines/3",
          "speaker": "character/native-3",
          "text": "我有不好的預感,大家要多小心!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 1,
              "speaker_name": "哈諾"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/4dd4fa178fb1/scenes/0/lines/4",
          "speaker": "character/native-1",
          "text": "哎呀!老爹你說對啦,前面果然有人來了!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": -1,
              "speaker_name": "法"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/4dd4fa178fb1/scenes/0/lines/5",
          "speaker": "legacy/speaker/4dd4fa178fb1/scenes/0/lines/5",
          "text": "約拿老頭,上次在你手裡折損了不少弟兄,今天這筆帳要一併討回來!準備受死吧!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 4,
              "speaker_name": "亞雷斯"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/4dd4fa178fb1/scenes/0/lines/6",
          "speaker": "character/native-4",
          "text": "可惡,又是陰魂不散的死亡骷髏!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 0,
              "speaker_name": "索爾"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/4dd4fa178fb1/scenes/0/lines/7",
          "speaker": "character/native-0",
          "text": "不知死活的傢伙,你們的罪業就到此為止了!我今天絕不放過你們!"
        }
      ],
      "scene_id": "legacy/scene/4dd4fa178fb1/scenes/0"
    },
    {
      "beats": [],
      "extensions": {
        "legacy": {
          "label": "巧遇巴拿羅西亞,獲悉聖寇拉斯行蹤"
        }
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 27,
              "speaker_name": "巴拿羅西亞"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/4dd4fa178fb1/scenes/1/lines/0",
          "speaker": "character/native-27",
          "text": "咦!這是惡名昭彰的「死亡骷髏」傭兵團啊!他們竟然在這裡出現,難道果真是有人在暗中...."
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 16,
              "speaker_name": "凱拉斯"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/4dd4fa178fb1/scenes/1/lines/1",
          "speaker": "character/native-16",
          "text": "嘿!那可不是巴拿羅西亞閣下嗎?真巧啊!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 27,
              "speaker_name": "巴拿羅西亞"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/4dd4fa178fb1/scenes/1/lines/2",
          "speaker": "character/native-27",
          "text": "啊!你是凱拉斯嘛!好一陣子沒碰面了,想不到會在這裡遇見你..."
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 16,
              "speaker_name": "凱拉斯"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/4dd4fa178fb1/scenes/1/lines/3",
          "speaker": "character/native-16",
          "text": "巴拿羅西亞閣下,現在可能不是敘舊的好時候,先讓我們解決了這幫想謀害約拿先生的惡徒再說。"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 27,
              "speaker_name": "巴拿羅西亞"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/4dd4fa178fb1/scenes/1/lines/4",
          "speaker": "character/native-27",
          "text": "約拿先生也在這裡?好極了,這場仗也算上我一份!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 16,
              "speaker_name": "凱拉斯"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/4dd4fa178fb1/scenes/1/lines/5",
          "speaker": "character/native-16",
          "text": "..為什麼..為什麼這些小鬼竟然如此厲害..."
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 27,
              "speaker_name": "巴拿羅西亞"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/4dd4fa178fb1/scenes/1/lines/6",
          "speaker": "character/native-27",
          "text": "這場仗打的真是漂亮!對於各位的表現,我個人真是非常佩服。"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 16,
              "speaker_name": "凱拉斯"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/4dd4fa178fb1/scenes/1/lines/7",
          "speaker": "character/native-16",
          "text": "巴拿羅西亞閣下,陛下不是和您在一起的嗎?"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 27,
              "speaker_name": "巴拿羅西亞"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/4dd4fa178fb1/scenes/1/lines/8",
          "speaker": "character/native-27",
          "text": "啊,我早該想到的,原來你是聖寇拉斯的部下..."
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 16,
              "speaker_name": "凱拉斯"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/4dd4fa178fb1/scenes/1/lines/9",
          "speaker": "character/native-16",
          "text": "是的,我們在行經死亡沼澤的途中發現「死亡骷髏」在此出沒,陛下擔心他們的目標可能是你們,所以命令我先來查看一番。"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 21,
              "speaker_name": "約拿"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/4dd4fa178fb1/scenes/1/lines/10",
          "speaker": "character/native-21",
          "text": "原來如此...那他往哪裡去了?"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 27,
              "speaker_name": "巴拿羅西亞"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/4dd4fa178fb1/scenes/1/lines/11",
          "speaker": "character/native-27",
          "text": "陛下說他已經發現了一些蛛絲馬跡,要趕往西方高塔一趟,我想現在應該還在路上吧。"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 13,
              "speaker_name": "貝克威"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/4dd4fa178fb1/scenes/1/lines/12",
          "speaker": "character/native-13",
          "text": "西方高塔...那不就是「聖靈之塔」嗎?那裡是我們精靈族的發源聖地,想不到敵人也看上了那裡,不知道他們有何意圖?"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 21,
              "speaker_name": "約拿"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/4dd4fa178fb1/scenes/1/lines/13",
          "speaker": "character/native-21",
          "text": "總之,我們要儘快和聖寇拉斯會合,看來他已發現了重要的線索,往後的幾天可能得趕一下路,大家忍耐一點。"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 0,
              "speaker_name": "索爾"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/4dd4fa178fb1/scenes/1/lines/14",
          "speaker": "character/native-0",
          "text": "這有什麼問題!倒是約拿先生您年事已大,可不要太勉強喔!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 21,
              "speaker_name": "約拿"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/4dd4fa178fb1/scenes/1/lines/15",
          "speaker": "character/native-21",
          "text": "呵呵..索爾,謝謝你的關心,我會注意的。我們這就上路吧!"
        }
      ],
      "scene_id": "legacy/scene/4dd4fa178fb1/scenes/1"
    }
  ],
